        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "When you have to write a long sentence, don't just string together phrases and clauses willy-nilly. Particularly avoid tacking one relative clause onto another onto another. Try extending the line of a sentence with resumptive, summative, and free modifiers.",
